  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pair: {垂|た}らす (transitive). Pattern: Xが{垂|た}れる.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{頭|こうべ}を{垂|た}れる (to bow one's head)\n・{汗|あせ}が{垂|た}れる (sweat drips)\n・{枝|えだ}が{垂|た}れる (branches hang down)\n・しだれ{桜|ざくら} (weeping cherry - from {垂|た}れる)\n\nIDIOM:\n・{実|みの}るほど{頭|こうべ}を{垂|た}れる{稲穂|いなほ}かな (The more accomplished one becomes, the more humble one should be)",
